strings.Settings.General.FunctionalModeHint:
The functionality mode defines the available capabilities:
• "User" — launch only, the system menu is hidden;
• "Specialist" — the full set of operations with the infobase list;
• "Developer" — currently matches "Specialist".

Currently "Specialist" and "Developer" provide the same full access and the menus do not differ. Real configuration developer tools will be added in upcoming roadmap stages.

